# L_Overworld.umap — STUB (COM-029)
# This file is a placeholder. The actual .umap binary must be created in UE5 Editor.
#
# Setup checklist (once UE5 is installed):
#   1. Open UE5 Editor → New Level → Empty Level → Save as Content/Maps/L_Overworld
#   2. World Settings → Game Mode Override → ACoMOverworldGameMode
#   3. World Settings → Default Pawn Class → ACoMCameraPawn
#   4. Add a Directional Light + Sky Atmosphere (placeholder lighting)
#   5. Add a Player Start at (0, 0, 100)
#   6. The UCoMWorldMapSubsystem (COM-026) will procedurally populate tiles at runtime
